#
# Externals, Spack-packages.yaml style: "name@version prefix", the prefix
# relative to $STORE (an absolute path is taken as-is). depends_on consults
# these only as a fallback: a recipe version always wins for a bare name, so
# externals matter for names with no recipe and for explicit @version pins.
# Within this table the first matching line wins, so list preferred first.
#
# The kaem phase's packages are not externals: their recipes list them in
# kaem-steps, and shpack takes them as installed at $STORE/<name>-<version>.
